# Pairs with RestoreConverges, under the fairness Spec asserts. A lift that leaves
# the restored copy closed refuses every delivery to it and blocks its drain for
# good, so a post-restore write never reaches the peer.
MODULE: RestoreConvergesResumeKeepsCopyClosed
TARGET: RestoreConverges
CLASS: Temporal
SUMMARY: the lift never opens the restored copy
PERTURBS: Resume

--- FIND
    /\ closed' = [closed EXCEPT ![c] = {}]
--- REPLACE
    \* MUTATION: the copy stays closed.
    /\ UNCHANGED closed
--- END
